{"method":{"methodHash":"0125554745acbe9e6c3f8a34924128c7","typeHash":"e4a6a66cfe6c7304f91b9ce2765912cc","name":"HasMeaningfulLoadDrop","filePath":"/Users/pratiksinghthakur/perproj/dotnet/Aimmy/Aimmy2/AILogic/PerformanceBenchmark.cs","bodySpan":{"startLine":423,"startColumn":9,"endLine":431,"endColumn":10},"calls":[]},"lines":["        private static bool HasMeaningfulLoadDrop(double baseline, double candidate)","        {","            if (baseline \u003C MeaningfulLoadDropPercent || candidate \u003E= baseline)","                return false;","","            double absoluteDrop = baseline - candidate;","            double relativeDrop = absoluteDrop / baseline;","            return absoluteDrop \u003E= MeaningfulLoadDropPercent || relativeDrop \u003E= MeaningfulLoadDropRatio;","        }"],"startLine":423}